    "C07K5/04": {
      "code": "C07K5/04",
      "level": 8,
      "parent": "C07K5/00",
      "ja": "ペプチド結合のみを含有するもの．｛注．．　グループ　Ｃ０７Ｋ５／０６　から　Ｃ０７Ｋ５／１０においては，下記の用語または表現は以下に示す意味で用いる:　．中性:　側鎖に同数のアミノ基とカルボン酸基またはその誘導体を持つアミノ酸，例．　Ｇｌｙ　　．塩基性:　側鎖にカルボン酸基またはその誘導体よりも多い数のアミノ基を持つアミノ酸，例．　Ａｒｇ　　．酸性:　側鎖にアミノ基よりも多い数のカルボン酸基またはその誘導体を持つアミノ酸，例．Ａｓｐ　　．脂肪族:　側鎖に非環式炭素原子のみを持つアミノ酸，例．　Ａｌａ　芳香族；　．脂環式:　側鎖に炭素環を持つアミノ酸，例．　Ｐｈｅ　．複素環式:　側鎖が複素環を含有するかその一部であるアミノ酸，例．　Ｐｒｏ　．側鎖:　随意的に官能基化されたアミノ酸のＲ　基　Ｒ－ＣＨ（ＮＨ２）Ｃ０２Ｈ）　｝",
      "en": "containing only normal peptide links<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br> In groups C07K5/06&#160;-&#160;C07K5/10 the following terms or expressions are used with the meaning indicated: <br>neutral:        amino acids having in the sidechain the same number of amino groups and carboxylic acid groups or derivatives thereof, e.g. Gly;<br>basic:          amino acids having in the sidechain more amino groups than carboxylic acid groups or derivatives thereof, e.g. Arg;<br>acidic:         amino acids having in the sidechain more carboxylic acid groups or derivatives thereof than amino groups, e.g. Asp;<br>aliphatic:      amino acids having only acyclic carbon atoms in the sidechain, e.g. Ala aromatic;<br>cycloaliphatic: amino acids having a carbocyclic ring in the sidechain, e.g. Phe<br>heterocyclic:   amino acids wherein the sidechain contains or is part of a heteroring, e.g. Pro;<br>side chain:     the R radical in the optionally functionalised amino acid R-CH(NH2)C02H)<br>",
      "count": 72,
      "ipcCode": "C07K5/04",
      "coreCode": "C07K5/04",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_C07K.txt",
      "kind": "cpc"
    },
